        <mxCell id="overview-legend" value="&lt;b&gt;Overview legend&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Click a VNet card for details. Dashed purple lines are VNet peerings; solid purple lines are Virtual WAN hub connections and VNet-to-VNet VPNs. A hub's many lines share one trunk that branches off to each VNet.&lt;br&gt;Arrowheads show the directions traffic may flow; red lines are not connected. Labels mark subnet peerings and other exceptions. NSGs, routes, and firewalls are not evaluated." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=light-dark(#f8f9fa,#26282c);strokeColor=light-dark(#adb5bd,#4a4f57);fontSize=10;align=left;spacingLeft=10;fontColor=light-dark(#000000,#dcdde0);" vertex="1" parent="1">
